Subject: [PATCH] =?UTF-8?q?feat(brand):=20the=20Grimaldi=20mark=20?=
 =?UTF-8?q?=E2=80=94=20one=20drawing=20across=20chrome,=20card=20and=20fav?=
 =?UTF-8?q?icon?=
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

Geometric V+G in round-capped strokes on the ink tile, signed with a
grid-frequency waveform in the network gradient (violet → sky → emerald):
software, hardware and energy in one line. Ships as a server-safe
BrandMark component (header, footer, business card) and as app/icon.svg;
the old text-monogram favicon (icon.png) is retired. The same artwork is
propagated to engineeringgrimaldi.com and grimaldi.ca so all three domains
carry a single identity.
